WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:10.424
Seven fifty-two in the morning. The desk opens at nine. But Ananya has been up all night. Her father slipped on the steps at home yesterday.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.600
Receptionist: Namaskara, Setu26 Synthetic Hospital. How can I help?

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.360
Ananya: My father slipped on the steps at home yesterday. His knee is badly swollen, and it hurts when he walks.

4
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:41.120
Receptionist: I'm sorry to hear that. Dr Rohan Pai in orthopaedics can see him today at 9:30, 9:45 or 10. Which would you like?

5
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:48.720
Ananya: 10 o'clock works. His name is Shankar Prabhu.

6
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:55.120
Receptionist: Shankar Prabhu, today at 10, with Dr Rohan Pai. Shall I book it?

7
00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:58.160
Ananya: Yes, please.

8
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:04.320
Receptionist: It's booked. Please come ten minutes early. I hope your father feels better soon.

9
00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:12.543
Booked. In Kannada. Into the doctor's real schedule. Before anyone at the desk has had their first chai.

10
00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:31.654
At nine, Manju opens the day. The morning's calls are already here: who called, what they needed, and what was done. Anything the receptionist couldn't finish is waiting as a callback, with the reason.

11
00:01:32.204 --> 00:01:42.328
Dr Rohan sees Shankar's whole story on one page, starting with this morning's call. He sees his own patients, and only them.

12
00:01:42.878 --> 00:01:52.770
The knee needs rest, and watching. Shankar is admitted to bed fifteen, in General Ward B. A bed can never be given to two patients.

13
00:01:53.320 --> 00:02:01.401
Upstairs, the ward is ready. Each nurse sees the patients in their care, and every task has an owner, and a time.

14
00:02:01.951 --> 00:02:17.462
And coming next, the Setu26 Staff app puts the ward round in the doctor's pocket. Before each bed records, it confirms the patient. Anything it isn't sure of waits for a person, and every flagged line is checked before the doctor signs.

15
00:02:18.012 --> 00:02:27.207
At eight, the shift changes. The handover is written down, and the night nurse accepts it, so nothing about Shankar falls between shifts.

16
00:02:27.757 --> 00:02:37.974
And Prakash, who owns the hospital, sees the whole day on one page. Beds, patients, tasks and staff on duty. Without a single phone call.

17
00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:46.930
Two days later, Shankar goes home. His discharge summary and his medicines are waiting in Ananya's Swasthya app.

18
00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:53.749
Downstairs, Kamala cleans his bed. Someone else checks it. Only then is it free for the next patient.

19
00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:59.082
One phone call. One record. Everyone who cared for him, on the same page.

20
00:02:59.632 --> 00:03:07.991
Setu26. Your hospital, connected. Book a demo at setu26.ka-26.com.
